<main id="content" class="site-main post mt-article"><div class="page-header"><h1 class="entry-title">Water Fountains 3 Things You Should Know About Them And Feng Shui</h1></div><div class="page-content"><p class="mt-article-meta"><time datetime="2021-10-13T14:24:18">October 13, 2021</time></p><figure class="mt-article-hero"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1.jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-800x533.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg.avif 600w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1.jpg 1170w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-950x320.avif 950w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px" width="1170" height="780" alt="Water Fountains 3 Things You Should Know About Them And Feng Shui" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure><div class="mt-article-body"><p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="78969" data-permalink="https://www.midwest-tropical.com/moving-boxes-in-new-apartment-real-estate-concept-70/" data-orig-file="/wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1.jpg" data-orig-size="1170,780" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="/wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg.avif" crossorigin="anonymous" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-78969" src="/wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui.jpg" alt="" width="1170" height="780" title="" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-600x400.avif 600w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-800x533.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-950x320.avif 950w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Fountains-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg.avif 1170w" sizes="(max-width: 1170px) 100vw, 1170px" data-mtfi="1"></p>
<p>Water is one of the five elements through which we achieve harmony in our home. It attracts wealth, prosperity, and abundance. And it is that, who does not relax listening to the wall fountain for home?</p>
<p>If you close your eyes and imagine a <a href="/waterwalls/">small wall fountains</a> indoor surrounded by nature, it transmits immense peace and serenity.</p>
<p><strong>Wall fountain design for home</strong></p>
<p>Feng Shui tries to connect us with nature through the objects that we have in our house. One of the objects you can use as a water element in your home is the Feng Shui <a href="/waterwalls/">wall fountain design for home</a>.</p>
<p>If you want to know a little more about them and how to use them, keep reading.</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Are water sources essential to have a good Feng Shui?</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>The answer is very simple: no.You will think that how can this be possible, water being one of the five elements with which we achieve harmony in Feng Shui. This is because if you do not like water sources, it is better not to have them.</p>
<p>A wall fountain for home is one of the possible elements, but not the only one. You can get the water element in another way, such as with the color blue or a painting of the sea.</p>
<p>But if you have a <a href="/waterwalls/">wall fountains</a> indoor that you buy because somewhere you have read that it is good for Feng Shui, knowing that it is an object that does not go with you or your decoration will become unused junk.</p>
<p>And what do we recommend to do with the junk? Get rid of them.</p>
<p><strong>KEY:</strong> If you want to know how to achieve personal, family tranquility and abundance through small changes in your home, without having to reform it or change your decoration, you need to take a look at wall fountain design for home.</p>
<ol start="2">
<li><strong>Surround yourself with only what you need, and it makes you happy.</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>A wall fountain for home that is stopped, not used, and with stagnant water due to lack of use will only paralyze the energy of the room where you have it and thus affect the Bagua area where it is located.In the attempt to want to do a good Feng Shui, you will achieve the opposite.In short, wall fountain design for home, yes, but only if you like them and will put them in motion.</p>
<ol start="3">
<li><strong>Characteristics that you should take into account when choosing Feng Shui water sources</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>Water is a very powerful element in Feng Shui. Therefore, if you have decided to get a wall fountain design for home because you like it, here are some guidelines that you should keep in mind:</p>
<p><strong>The shape and what it represents:</strong></p>
<p>In this case, you should pay close attention to the room where you want to place it and if that font makes sense with the rest of the decorative objects.</p>
<p><strong>Sound:</strong></p>
<p>Once you have chosen your ideal wall fountain for home, now you have to consider the sound of the water falling. Do you like it? Find a sound that pleases you and relaxes you.</p>
<p>Of course, you also have to take into account the engine noise. It often happens that, in small fountains, the sound of the motor is louder than that of the water jump. This you should avoid. Because in the long run, it will bother you! Find some Feng Shui wall fountains indoor with which you can only hear the relaxing noise of the waterfall.</p>
<p><strong>The size:</strong></p>
<p>You must follow your intuition again since no size is the most recommended, but it is a matter of taste and the place where you want to place it.</p>
<p>An outdoor fountain will always be larger than a wall fountains indoor, and the sound of falling water will also be louder. Inside, for space, the Feng Shui water fountain will be smaller, logically. But we encourage you not to condition yourself.</p>
</div></div></main>

